                        <span>How long does it take to see results?</span>
                        <i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-icon"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        Most customers see visible results within 2-4 weeks of consistent use. For best results, use the recommended amount and follow your skincare routine daily.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                        <span>Are your products suitable for all skin types?</span>
                        <i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-icon"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        We have specialized products for all skin types: Dry, Oily, Combination, Sensitive, and Normal. Use our skin type filter to find products suited to your needs.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                        <span>What is your return policy?</span>
                        <i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-icon"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        We offer a 30-day money-back guarantee on all products. If you're not satisfied, simply return the item within 30 days for a full refund, no questions asked.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                        <span>Are your products cruelty-free?</span>
                        <i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-icon"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        Yes! All our products are 100% cruelty-free and ethically sourced. We never test on animals and partner only with suppliers who share our values.
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="faq-item">
                    <div class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
                        <span>Do you offer free shipping?</span>
                        <i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-icon"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faq-answer">
                        Yes! We offer free shipping on all orders over ₹500. Standard delivery takes 2-3 business days within India. Express shipping is also available.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

